      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Qu\xEA Thanh H\xE0, H\u1EA3i D\u01B0\u01A1ng; l\xE0 Ti\u1EC3u \u0111\u1ED9i tr\u01B0\u1EDFng, \u0110\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ED9i 51, Ti\u1EC3u \u0111o\xE0n 5, Trung \u0111o\xE0n 2, Qu\xE2n khu 1. Trong cu\u1ED9c chi\u1EBFn ch\u1ED1ng qu\xE2n Trung Qu\u1ED1c x\xE2m l\u01B0\u1EE3c, \u0111\u1ED3ng ch\xED \u0111\xE3 chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u anh d\u0169ng v\xE0 hy sinh t\u1EA1i L\u1EA1ng S\u01A1n. Truy t\u1EB7ng Anh h\xF9ng l\u1EF1c l\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\u0169 trang nh\xE2n d\xE2n n\u0103m 1979.\n\nA native of Thanh Ha District, Hai Duong Province; He was the squad leader of Company 51, Battalion 5, Regiment 2, Military Zone 1. During the war against Chinese invaders, he fought heroically and died in Lang Son. He was posthumously awarded the title \"Hero of People's Armed Forces\" in 1979."
