      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Qu\xEA Th\u1ECD Xu\xE2n, Thanh H\xF3a; l\xE0 Thi\u1EBFu u\xFD, \u0110\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ED9i tr\u01B0\u1EDFng \u0110\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ED9i 42, Ti\u1EC3u \u0111o\xE0n 4, Trung \u0111o\xE0n 12, Qu\xE2n khu 1, chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u \u1EDF khu v\u1EF1c \u0110\u1ED3ng \u0110\u0103ng, t\u1EC9nh L\u1EA1ng S\u01A1n. \u0110\u1ED3ng ch\xED hy sinh 25/02/1979 t\u1EA1i L\u1EA1ng S\u01A1n. Truy t\u1EB7ng Anh h\xF9ng l\u1EF1c l\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\u0169 trang nh\xE2n d\xE2n n\u0103m 1979.\n\nA native of Tho Xuan District, Thanh Hoa Province; He was a Second Lieutenant, Commander of Company 42, Battalion 4, Regiment 12, Military Zone 1, fighting in the Dong Dang area, Lang Son Province. He died on February 25, 1979 in Lang Son. He was posthumously awarded the title \"Hero of People's Armed Forces\" in 1979."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
