  m_text: "Qu\xEA Kinh M\xF4n, H\u1EA3i D\u01B0\u01A1ng; l\xE0 Th\u01B0\u1EE3ng s\u0129, \u0110\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ED9i tr\u01B0\u1EDFng \u0110\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ED9i 6, Ti\u1EC3u \u0111o\xE0n 2, Trung \u0111o\xE0n 192 Ho\xE0ng Li\xEAn S\u01A1n. Trong khi chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u gi\u1EEF ch\u1ED1t C\u1ED1c San \u1EDF huy\u1EC7n B\xE1t X\xE1t, t\u1EC9nh L\xE0o Cai, \u0111\u1ED3ng ch\xED \u0111\xE3 anh d\u0169ng hy sinh ng\xE0y 17/02/1979. Truy t\u1EB7ng Anh h\xF9ng l\u1EF1c l\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\u0169 trang nh\xE2n d\xE2n n\u0103m 1979.\n\nA native of Kinh Mon District, Hai Duong Province; He was a sergeant and commander of Company 6 of Batlalion 2, Regiment 192 Hoang Lien Son. While fighting to defend Coc San checkpoint in Bat Sat District, Lao Cai Province, he heroically sacrificed his life on February 17, 1979. He was posthumously awarded the title \"Hero of People's Armed Forces\" in 1979."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
