  m_text: "B\xE0 N\xF4ng Th\u1ECB T\u1EF5, nh\xE2n ch\u1EE9ng s\u1ED1ng s\xF3t c\u1EE7a qu\xE2n Trung Qu\u1ED1c \u1EDF th\xF4n T\u1ED5ng Ch\xFAp, x\xE3 H\u01B0ng \u0110\u1EA1o, t\u1EC9nh Cao B\u1EB1ng, \u0111ang tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi ph\xF3ng vi\xEAn qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF, 1979\nNong Thi Ty, a witness surviving the massacre by the Chinese troops in Tong Chup Village, Hung Dao Commune, Cao Bang Province, answering foreign reporters, 1979 "
