  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9541d86e2fd84c1d9990edf0852d74ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshPro
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Sinh 1954, qu\xEA T\u1EE9 K\u1EF3, H\u1EA3i D\u01B0\u01A1ng; l\xE0 Ch\xEDnh tr\u1ECB vi\xEAn \u0110\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ED9i \u0110\u1EB7c c\xF4ng, Ti\u1EC3u \u0111o\xE0n 45, B\u1ED9 T\u01B0 l\u1EC7nh \u0110\u1EB7c c\xF4ng, \u0111\u1ED3ng ch\xED \u0111\xE3 l\u1EADp nhi\u1EC1u th\xE0nh t\xEDch xu\u1EA5t s\u1EAFc trong cu\u1ED9c chi\u1EBFn ch\u1ED1ng qu\xE2n Trung Qu\u1ED1c x\xE2m l\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA1i Cao B\u1EB1ng. Phong t\u1EB7ng Anh h\xF9ng l\u1EF1c l\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\u0169 trang nh\xE2n d\xE2n n\u0103m 1979.\n\nBorn in 1954, he was a native of Tu Ky District, Hai Duong Province; As political officer of the Special forces Company, Battalion 45, Special force Command, he accomplished many outstanding feats in the battle against Chinese invaders in Cao Bang. He was awarded the title \"Hero of People's Armed Forces\" in 1979."
