  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Nh\xE0 c\u1EEDa c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED3ng b\xE0o b\u1EA3n H\u1EA1, x\xE3 Ph\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0110\u1ED9, huy\u1EC7n V\u1ECB Xuy\xEAn, t\u1EC9nh H\xE0 Tuy\xEAn, b\u1ECB \u0111\u1EA1n ph\xE1o x\xE2m l\u01B0\u1EE3c t\xE0n ph\xE1\nThe houses of the people in Ha Village, Phuong Do Commune, Vi Xuyen District, Ha Tuyen Province were destroyed by invading forces's artillery, 1979"
