--- !u!114 &1503001857
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1503001856}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9541d86e2fd84c1d9990edf0852d74ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshPro
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Vi\u1EC7t Nam v\xE0 Trung Qu\u1ED1c c\xF3 quan h\u1EC7 h\u1EEFu ngh\u1ECB truy\u1EC1n th\u1ED1ng l\xE2u \u0111\u1EDDi. Trong hai cu\u1ED9c kh\xE1ng chi\u1EBFn ch\u1ED1ng th\u1EF1c d\xE2n Ph\xE1p v\xE0 \u0111\u1EBF qu\u1ED1c M\u1EF9, Trung Qu\u1ED1c \u0111\xE3 \u1EE7ng h\u1ED9, gi\xFAp \u0111\u1EE1 Vi\u1EC7t Nam nhi\u1EC7t t\xECnh v\xE0 hi\u1EC7u qu\u1EA3.\r\n\r\nT\u1EEB n\u0103m 1978, Trung Qu\u1ED1c c\u1EAFt vi\u1EC7n tr\u1EE3, r\xFAt chuy\xEAn gia v\u1EC1 n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0 cho qu\xE2n khi\xEAu kh\xEDch d\u1ECDc tuy\u1EBFn bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi v\u1EDBi Vi\u1EC7t Nam. Ng\xE0y 17/02/1979, Trung Qu\u1ED1c ti\u1EBFn c\xF4ng x\xE2m l\u01B0\u1EE3c 6 t\u1EC9nh bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi ph\xEDa B\u1EAFc c\u1EE7a Vi\u1EC7t Nam.\n\nQu\xE2n v\xE0 d\xE2n Vi\u1EC7t Nam \u0111\xE3 chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u \u0111\u1EA9y l\xF9i c\xE1c cu\u1ED9c ti\u1EBFn c\xF4ng c\u1EE7a qu\xE2n Trung Qu\u1ED1c. B\u1ECB t\u1ED5n th\u1EA5t n\u1EB7ng n\u1EC1 v\xE0 d\u01B0 lu\u1EADn qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF l\xEAn \xE1n, ng\xE0y 05/3/1979, Trung Qu\u1ED1c r\xFAt qu\xE2n, nh\u01B0ng tr\xEAn th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF, v\u1EABn chi\u1EBFm \u0111\xF3ng tr\xE1i ph\xE9p m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ECBa b\xE0n thu\u1ED9c c\xE1c t\u1EC9nh L\u1EA1ng S\u01A1n, Cao B\u1EB1ng, H\xE0 Giang v\xE0 th\u01B0\u1EDDng xuy\xEAn g\xE2y xung \u0111\u1ED9t v\u0169 trang \u1EDF c\xE1c t\u1EC9nh bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi. N\u0103m 1989, cu\u1ED9c chi\u1EBFn ch\u1EA5m d\u1EE9t, h\xF2a b\xECnh th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EADp l\u1EA1i tr\xEAn l\xE3nh th\u1ED5 Vi\u1EC7t Nam.\n\n\r\n<i>Vietnam and China maintained a long-standing traditional friendship. During the two resistance wars against French colonialists and American imperialists, China supported and helped Vietnam enthusiastically and effectively.\r\n\r\nIn 1978, China cut off aid, withdrew experts and took provocative acts along the border with Vietnam. On February 17, 1979, China invaded six northern border provinces of Vietnam.\n\nVietnamese troops and people fought to repel Chinese attacks. Suffering heavy losses and international condemnation, on March 5, 1979, China withdrew its troops, but in fact, still illegally occupied a number of areas in the provinces of Lang Son, Cao Bang, and Ha Giang, and often caused armed conflicts at border areas. In 1989, the war came to an end and peace was truly restored in Vietnam.</size></i>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
