  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Qu\xEA Tr\u1EA5n Y\xEAn, Y\xEAn B\xE1i; l\xE0 chi\u1EBFn s\u0129 trinh s\xE1t \u0110\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ED9i 20, Trung \u0111o\xE0n 124, Qu\xE2n khu 2. Trong tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 \u0111\xE0i quan s\xE1t tr\xEAn \u0111i\u1EC3m cao 598, 433, huy\u1EC7n B\u1EA3o Th\u1EAFng, t\u1EC9nh L\xE0o Cai, \u0111\u1ED3ng ch\xED \u0111\xE3 anh d\u0169ng chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u v\xE0 hy sinh ng\xE0y 28/02/1979. Truy t\u1EB7ng Anh h\xF9ng L\u1EF1c l\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\u0169 trang nh\xE2n d\xE2n n\u0103m 1979.\n\nA native of Tran Yen District, Yen Bai Province; he was a reconnaissance soldier of Company 20, Regiment 124, Military Zone 2. In the battle to protect the observatory on high grounds 598, 433, Bao Thang Distric, Lao Cai Province, he heroically fought and died on February 28, 1979. He was posthumously awarded the title \"Hero of People's Armed Forces\" in 1979."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
