--- !u!114 &1839502485
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1839502483}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9541d86e2fd84c1d9990edf0852d74ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshPro
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=24><b>Trung Qu\u1ED1c x\xE2m l\u01B0\u1EE3c\r\nVi\u1EC7t Nam, 17/02-18/3/1979</b></size>\r\n\r\n<size=16><b>China invading Vietnam,\r\nFebruary 17-March 18, 1979</b></size>\r\n\r\n<size=13>Nh\u1EEFng n\u0103m \u0111\u1EA7u Vi\u1EC7t Nam th\u1ED1ng nh\u1EA5t \u0111\u1EA5t n\u01B0\u1EDBc, Trung Qu\u1ED1c \u0111\xE3 t\u0103ng c\u01B0\u1EDDng c\xE1c ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng qu\xE2n s\u1EF1, khi\xEAu kh\xEDch v\u0169 trang, x\xE2m l\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EA5t \u0111ai, g\xE2y t\xECnh h\xECnh c\u0103ng th\u1EB3ng \u1EDF bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi ph\xEDa B\u1EAFc Vi\u1EC7t Nam.\nNg\xE0y 17/02/1979, Trung Qu\u1ED1c huy \u0111\u1ED9ng h\u01A1n 60 v\u1EA1n qu\xE2n, 500 xe t\u0103ng, thi\u1EBFt gi\xE1p, c\xF9ng h\xE0ng ng\xE0n kh\u1EA9u ph\xE1o, \u1ED3 \u1EA1t ti\u1EBFn c\xF4ng x\xE2m l\u01B0\u1EE3c Vi\u1EC7t Nam t\u1EEB Phong Th\u1ED5 (Lai Ch\xE2u) \u0111\u1EBFn M\xF3ng C\xE1i (Qu\u1EA3ng Ninh). Trong v\xF2ng 1 th\xE1ng, qu\xE2n Trung Qu\u1ED1c \u0111\xE3 h\u1EE7y di\u1EC7t 4 th\u1ECB x\xE3: L\xE0o Cai, Cao B\u1EB1ng, Cam \u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng, L\u1EA1ng S\u01A1n, th\u1EA3m s\xE1t nh\xE2n d\xE2n v\xE0 g\xE2y nhi\u1EC1u t\u1ED5n th\u1EA5t cho l\u1EF1c l\u01B0\u1EE3ng b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi \u1EDF 6 t\u1EC9nh ph\xEDa B\u1EAFc c\u1EE7a Vi\u1EC7t Nam.</size>\r\n\r\n<size=11><i>In the early years of Vietnam's reunification, China escalated military activities, armed provocations, and land invasions, causing tension on Vietnam's northern border.\nOn February 17, 1979, China mobilized more than 600,000 troops, 500 tanks, armored vehicles, and thousands of artillery pieces to attack Vietnam from Phong Tho (Lai Chau) to Mong Cai (Quang Ninh). Within 1 month, Chinese forces destroyed 4 towns: Lao Cai, Cao Bang, Cam Duong, Lang Son, massacring people and causing many losses to border protection forces in 6 northern provinces of Vietnam.</i></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
