  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Qu\xEA Nghi Xu\xE2n, H\xE0 T\u0129nh. Trong cu\u1ED9c chi\u1EBFn b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi ph\xEDa B\u1EAFc 1979, Trung \xFAy Phan \u0110\xECnh Linh l\xE0 Ch\xEDnh tr\u1ECB vi\xEAn \u0110\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ED9i 10, Ti\u1EC3u \u0111o\xE0n 6, Trung \u0111o\xE0n 677, S\u01B0 \u0111o\xE0n 346, Qu\xE2n khu 1, \u0111\xE3 m\u01B0u tr\xED, d\u0169ng c\u1EA3m ch\u1EC9 huy chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u v\xE0 anh d\u0169ng hy sinh. Truy t\u1EB7ng Anh h\xF9ng l\u1EF1c l\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\u0169 trang nh\xE2n d\xE2n n\u0103m 1979.\n\nA native of Nghi Xuan District, Ha Tinh Province. During the war to protect the Northern border in 1979, Lieutenant Phan Dinh Linh as political officer of Company 10, Battalion 6, Regiment 677, Division 346, Military Zone 1, cleverly and courageously commanded the battle and sacrificed his life. He was posthumously awarded the title \"Hero of People's Armed Forces\" in 1979."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
