--- !u!114 &2130585109
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2130585107}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9541d86e2fd84c1d9990edf0852d74ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshPro
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=24><b>Chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi ph\xEDa B\u1EAFc, \n17/02-18/3/1979</b></size>\r\r\n<size=16><b>Fighting to protect the Northern border, February 17-March 18, 1979</b></size>\r\n\r\n<size=13>Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc cu\u1ED9c ti\u1EBFn c\xF4ng quy m\xF4 l\u1EDBn c\u1EE7a qu\xE2n Trung Qu\u1ED1c, v\u1EDBi th\u1EBF tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn tranh nh\xE2n d\xE2n, qu\xE2n v\xE0 d\xE2n Vi\u1EC7t Nam tr\xEAn tuy\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA7u T\u1ED5 qu\u1ED1c \u0111\xE3 k\u1ECBp th\u1EDDi \u0111\xE1nh tr\u1EA3, b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 ch\u1EE7 quy\u1EC1n thi\xEAng li\xEAng c\u1EE7a T\u1ED5 qu\u1ED1c.\n\nTr\u1EA3i qua h\u01A1n 30 ng\xE0y chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u, qu\xE2n v\xE0 d\xE2n ta \u0111\xE3 lo\u1EA1i kh\u1ECFi v\xF2ng chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u 62.500 qu\xE2n, ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t v\xE0 \u0111\xE1nh thi\u1EC7t h\u1EA1i n\u1EB7ng 3 trung \u0111o\xE0n, 18 ti\u1EC3u \u0111o\xE0n, ph\xE1 h\u1EE7y 550 xe qu\xE2n s\u1EF1, thu nhi\u1EC1u v\u0169 kh\xED v\xE0 \u0111\u1ED3 d\xF9ng qu\xE2n s\u1EF1. Th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i n\u1EB7ng n\u1EC1, Trung Qu\u1ED1c ph\u1EA3i r\xFAt qu\xE2n v\u1EC1 n\u01B0\u1EDBc.\n\nNh\u1EEFng \u0111\u1ECBa danh nh\u01B0 Ph\xE1o \u0111\xE0i \u0110\u1ED3ng \u0110\u0103ng (L\u1EA1ng S\u01A1n), \u0111\u1ED3n Bi\xEAn ph\xF2ng Pha Long (L\xE0o Cai), P\xF2 H\xE8n (Qu\u1EA3ng Ninh), Ma L\xF9 Th\xE0ng (Lai Ch\xE2u), th\xF4n T\u1ED5ng Ch\xFAp (Cao B\u1EB1ng),... in s\xE2u k\xFD \u1EE9c v\u1EC1 cu\u1ED9c chi\u1EBFn..</size>\r\n\r\n<size=11><i>Faced with the large-scale attack of the Chinese army, thanks to the people's war posture, the Vietnamese army and people on the front line promptly launched counterattacks, protecting the sacred sovereignty of the Fatherland.\n\nAfter more than 30 days of fierce combat, Vietnamese army and people eliminated 62,500 troops, inflicted severe damage to 3 regiments, 18 battalions, destroyed 550 military vehicles, and seized many military weapons and supplies. Having suffered devastating defeat, China had to withdraw its troops back home.\n\nPlaces such as Dong Dang Fortress (Lang Son), Pha Long Border Guard Station (Lao Cai), Po Hen (Quang Ninh), Ma Lu Thang (Lai Chau), Tong Chup village (Cao Bang),... are imprinted with the memories of the war.</i></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
